'''Spitter''' is the [[Omnitrix]]'s DNA sample of a [[Sphoeroid]] from the planet [[Scalpasc]].{{Refn|[[:File:Scalpasc is Rainy.png]]|group = pop-up}}<ref name="B10K"/>

==Appearance==
===Ben 10,000 as Spitter===
Spitter is a bulbous alien resembling a pufferfish with legs that is colored green on its outer side and pale green on its inner side. He has five sensory organs;{{Refn|[[:File:Spitter's sensory organs.png]]|group = TNP}} three sticking out the top and one pair from the bottom of his head, arms with four-fingered hands, short and stubby legs, and a long tail. His mouth covers mostly the front of him, which is filled with pointed teeth, and his eyes are connected to the corners of his lips. He wears a pair of black pants that partly cover his stomach.

In the '''[[Ben 10 (2005 TV Series)|Original Series]]''', Spitter had yellowish-green eyes, dull-colored teeth, and his gums were the same hue of green as the outer side of his skin. He wears the [[Omnitrix (Original Future)|Omnitrix]] symbol on his stomach.

===Ben as Spitter===
In the '''[[Ben 10: Ultimate Alien (TV Series)|Ultimate Alien]]''' [[Ben 10: Ultimate Alien (TV Series)/Theme Song|intro]], Spitter looks exactly the same as before, except his eyes are recolored light green, his teeth are recolored white, and his gums are recolored dark green. He also has lighter skin.
Spitter wears the [[Ultimatrix (Original)|Ultimatrix]] symbol on his stomach.

===Ken as Spitter===
[[Ken Tennyson (Original)|Ken]]'s Spitter looked the same as [[Ben 10,000 (Original)|Ben 10,000]]'s Spitter in the '''Original Series'''.

