==Powers and Abilities==
[[File:B10Mil (303).png|thumb|Slime Spit/Body Inflation]]
By inflating his upper body, Spitter can unleash a concentrated blast of slime that can effectively launch away large and bulky opponents, such as, [[Dr. Animo (Original Future)|Doctor Animo]]; [[Vilgax (Original Future)|Vilgax]];<ref name="B10K"/> [[Mot Snikrep]]; and [[Kevin 11,000]].<ref name="K10">''[[Ken 10]]''</ref> Additionally, his slime is slippery and highly conductive, allowing electricity-producing allies, such as [[Nosedeenian (Classic)|Nosedeenians]], to amplify the power of their attacks on opponents covered with it, as shown by Kevin 11,000.<ref name="K10" />

Spitter is amphibious, tending to towards land or shallow waters.{{Refn|[[:File:Spitter amphibious.png]]|group = TNP}}

==History==
===Ben 10===
*Spitter was unlocked off-screen after '''''[[Ben 10: Destroy All Aliens]]'''''.{{Refn|[[:File:OV Spitter Unlocked During Flashbacks.PNG]]|group = DJW|name = unlock1}}

===Alien Force=== 
*Spitter was locked by the Omnitrix's reconfiguration in ''[[Ben 10 Returns: Part 1]]''.

===[[Original Future Timeline|Original Future]]===
*Spitter first appeared in ''[[Ben 10,000 (Episode)|Ben 10,000]]'', where he battled [[Dr. Animo (Original Future)|Dr. Animo]]. Later, he fought [[Vilgax (Original Future)|Vilgax]] before switching into [[Arctiguana]].
*In ''[[Ken 10]]'', Ben 10,000 as Spitter battled [[Mot Snikrep]] before switching into [[Diamondhead (Classic)|Diamondhead]]. Later, Ken as Spitter blasted [[Kevin 11,000]] with slime before switching into [[Buzzshock (Classic)|Buzzshock]].

