==Trivia==
*Not counting [[Wildmutt]], Spitter is the only regular alien to have never spoken on-screen.
*Spitter and [[Upchuck]] are the only two aliens in '''[[Ben 10: Ultimate Alien (TV Series)|Ultimate Alien]]''' to not have the [[Ultimatrix (Original)|Ultimatrix]] symbol on their chests and instead have it on their stomachs.
*Spitter and [[Eon (Transformation)|Eon]] are the only two regular transformations that has never been used by Ben Prime on-screen.
*Spitter is also the only regular alien featured in the '''Original Series''' that did not appear in '''[[Ben 10: Omniverse (TV Series)|Omniverse]]'''.
**Spitter was absent from '''Omniverse''' likely because the crew ran out of time. They tried to include as many aliens as they could during production,{{Refn|[[:File:Spitter Scrapped in OV Explanation.png]]|group = DJW}} however, Spitter probably didn't come up during any episode discussions.{{Refn|[[:File:Spitter Scrapped in OV Explanation 2.png]]|group = DJW}}
*During '''Omniverse'''<nowiki>'</nowiki>s early run, [[Matt Wayne]] believed that [[Ben Tennyson (Classic)|Ben]] had not unlocked Spitter as of ''[[The Frogs of War: Part 2]]''.{{Refn|[[:File:Spitter Not Unlocked in OV.png]]|group = MW}} Later during the show's run, [[Derrick J. Wyatt]] stated that Spitter was unlocked off-screen sometime after '''''[[Ben 10: Destroy All Aliens]]''''' and is available to Ben in present day.{{Refn|[[:File:OV Spitter Unlocked During Flashbacks.PNG]]|group = DJW}}
**Correlating with this, when asked if [[Benzarro]] has access to Spitter, Derrick stated "It seems like he has access to most of what Ben does".{{Refn|[[:File:Benzarro Spitter.PNG]]|group = DJW}}
*Spitter's '''[[Ben 10 (2005 TV Series)|Original Series]]''' design was made by [[Thomas N. Perkins IV]]{{Refn|[[:File:Tom Designed S3 & S4 Characters.png]]|group = TNP}} and re-purposed from one of Perk [[Upchuck]]'s concept designs.
*Had Spitter appeared in '''Omniverse''', he probably would have looked pretty similar to his '''Original Series''' design but with a new costume with more green on it.{{Refn|[[:File:OV Spitter New Costume.PNG]]|group = DJW}}{{Refn|[[:File:OV Spitter New Costume 2.PNG]]|group = DJW}}
**[[Derrick J. Wyatt]] and [[Thomas N. Perkins IV]] would have preferred [[Fred Tatasciore]] as his voice actor.{{Refn|[[:File:OV Spitter & Chamalien Voices.png]]|group = DJW}}{{Refn|[[:File:Tom Perkins would cast Fred Tatasciore as Spitter.png]]|group = TNP}}
*In 2020, Derrick designed a version of Spitter as a third-party commission. It can be found in the [[Spitter/Gallery|gallery]].
*There were no plans to feature Spitter in the '''[[Ben 10 (2016 TV Series)|Reboot]]'''.{{Refn|[[:File:RB No Spitter or Chamalien.png]]|group = DR}}

